### SOURCENAME MCP Service
### NestJS Lambda spoke for SOURCENAME integration
###
### Environment configuration:
###   local      — no auth required, runs on localhost:3000
###   tools-test — requires bearer token in http-client.private.env.json
###
### Set bearer token in http-client.private.env.json:
###   { "local": {}, "tools-test": { "authToken": "your-token-here" } }

# TEMPLATE: Update baseUrl in http-client.env.json with your deployed API GW URL.

### =============================================================================
### Health
### =============================================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### =============================================================================
### MCP Endpoints
### =============================================================================

### MCP — initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sourcename/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {}
}

### MCP — tools/list
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sourcename/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}

### MCP — tools/call (example_get)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sourcename/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "example_get",
    "arguments": {
      "resource_id": "test-123",
      "response_mode": "summary"
    }
  }
}

### MCP — dedicated tools/list endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sourcename/mcp/tools/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 4
}

### =============================================================================
### Callback Endpoint (no auth — called by agent-router)
### =============================================================================

### Callback — job completed
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sourcename/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed",
  "output": "Agent completed the task successfully.",
  "source": "sourcename",
  "intent": "TEST",
  "metadata": {
    "resourceId": "test-resource-1"
  }
}
